allocation done on another thread. We can check this is true in the docs for
`libc::free`.

```
#![allow(unused)]
fn main() {
struct Carton<T>(std::ptr::NonNull<T>);
mod libc {
 pub use ::std::os::raw::c_void;
 unsafe extern "C" { pub fn free(p: *mut c_void); }
